    {
      "id": "s06",
      "type": "GRID_ARRAY",
      "narration": "But raw size is only half the story. Inside sit eight hundred ninety-six experts, and just sixteen of them activate for any single token — a giant staff, a tiny task force per job.",
      "durationFrames": 386,
